From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gork CI <gork-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:58:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] security-dependency-refresh: advance vulnerable dependencies

Refresh security-sensitive dependency constraints while the public upstream
source remains pinned at 1.0.45. Keep the changes narrow: move JWT verification
to the AWS-LC backend, advance bundled SQLite to the patched rusqlite line, and
move ZIP readers/writers to the post-advisory 9.x API line.

Gork-Patch-Id: security-dependency-refresh
Gork-Invariant: cargo-audit-no-known-vulnerabilities
Gork-Risk: critical
---
